Beyond property sales, Housfy has expanded its offerings to include mortgage brokerage, financial services, and other related home services. This strategic expansion has positioned the company as a one-stop-shop for all housing-related needs, from the initial transaction to the ongoing management and financing of a home. The platform''s business model is based on a fixed-fee structure for its services, providing transparency and predictability to its clients, who are primarily private individuals in the residential real estate market.

