The firm''s core business is providing specialized insurance coverage for consumer electronic devices for both individual and business clients. Its product portfolio includes modular insurance for single mobile phones and multi-device plans, as well as coverage for items like scooters. A key feature of their offering is the inclusion of coverage for theft, such as pickpocketing, and extending protection to both new and used devices. The business model leverages an omnichannel distribution strategy, utilizing direct-to-consumer (B2C) sales through its own digital channels and call centers, and a business-to-business-to-consumer (B2B2C) approach through strategic partnerships with tech retailers and consumer finance companies. Strategic partners have included prominent names like Amazon, Xiaomi, and Banco Santander. Revenue is generated through the sale of these insurance policies.

Insurama has built a proprietary, scalable platform that manages the entire insurance lifecycle, from quoting and sales to claims processing, ensuring a fully digital customer journey. The company has secured significant funding to fuel its growth, raising a total of $20.8 million over three rounds from investors including Inveready, All Iron Ventures, and BBVA Spark. This capital supports an aggressive international expansion plan which began in 2021. After establishing itself in Spain and Portugal, the company has expanded its operations into Latin America, with a presence in Mexico, Chile, Peru, and Colombia. 

Keywords: insurtech, MGA, device insurance, electronics protection, digital insurance, embedded insurance, omnichannel distribution, mobile insurance, multi-device coverage, claims processing, B2B2C insurance, consumer electronics, insurtech MGA, Sergio Balsa Pardo, international expansion, Latin America insurance, Helvetia, GNP Seguros, modular insurance, digital customer journey', '["accelerator","database","data security","Insurtech Distribution and Brokerage","PandC Insurance","Venture Capital","email hosting","web fonts","Subscription","SaaS","frameworks and libraries","Product Insurance","content management system","Fintech","it infrastructure","b2b","web platform extensions","Insurance","web servers","search engines","content delivery network","programming languages","Breakout stage","website builders","site search","web & portal technology","web and application servers","programming","cloud infrastructure computing","business intelligence","javascript libraries","wordpress plugins","intelligence and analytics","analytics","security","platform as a service","consent management","font scripts","blogs","ui frameworks","web tools and plugins","web hosting"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 73.54, 25000, 1, 9, 39999984, NULL, NULL, 356629, 2024, '[{"year":2023,"revenue":5804075,"ebitda":null,"profit":-83289,"rnd":null,"valuation":24999990,"employees":44},{"year":2024,"revenue":4202959,"ebitda":null,"profit":356629,"rnd":null,"valuation":39999984,"employees":59},{"year":2025,"revenue":4202959,"ebitda":null,"profit":356629,"rnd":null,"valuation":39999984,"employees":75},{"year":2026,"revenue":4202959,"ebitda":null,"profit":356629,"rnd":null,"valuation":39999984,"employees":80}]', '2026-11-05T15:40:24.979Z', 'GBP', '2024-09', 'Debt', 4583331);

Moo''s commitment to excellence is evident in every aspect of its operations. The company designs, manufactures, and sells its products to customers worldwide, ensuring that each item meets the highest standards of quality and design. With a team of over 450 employees and five locations across the UK and US, Moo has grown significantly while maintaining its focus on delivering exceptional products.

What sets Moo apart is its dedication to great design and superior quality. Unlike typical branded merchandise, Moo''s products are crafted with attention to detail and a keen eye for aesthetics. This ensures that customers receive items that not only serve their practical purposes but also enhance their brand image.

Moo''s user-friendly platform allows customers to easily customize their products, choosing from a variety of templates and design options. Whether it''s creating unique business cards, personalized notebooks, or branded packaging, Moo provides the tools and resources needed to bring creative visions to life.

The company is also committed to sustainability and ethical practices. Moo sources materials responsibly and implements eco-friendly manufacturing processes, demonstrating its commitment to environmental stewardship.

