The company''s business model is based on a usage-based pricing structure, charging clients only for the services they use. This approach allows for scalability as users and projects can be easily adjusted according to the client''s needs. Matillion''s platform is powered by artificial intelligence (AI), enabling the integration of large language models (LLMs) directly into data pipelines and the automatic generation of documentation to increase data literacy.

Matillion''s platform also offers a library of hundreds of connectors, allowing data to be moved to and from any source or cloud data platform. This feature, coupled with the ability to perform complex transformations quickly and easily, meets the growing business demands for efficient data management. The platform also simplifies the orchestration of data pipelines, providing a unified view of all data pipelines, from no-code to SQL, Python, and dbt.

In summary, Matillion is a data management platform that leverages AI to enhance productivity for data teams, offering scalable solutions for building, managing, and orchestrating data pipelines.

