Nested''s business model combines technology with the expertise of local agents. This hybrid approach provides customers with the convenience of an online platform, while still offering the personalized service of a traditional estate agent. The company''s services include property valuation, marketing, and negotiation of sales. Additionally, Nested assists clients in negotiating the purchase of their new home. The company primarily serves homeowners in the UK who are looking to sell their current property and buy a new one simultaneously. Nested generates revenue by charging a fee for their services, which is comparable to that of a high street agent.

