TopDoctors.es employs a subscription-based business model where medical professionals pay to be listed on the platform, ensuring they reach a broader audience. Additionally, the platform generates revenue through appointment booking fees and telemedicine services. 
The company leverages advanced technology to offer features such as online appointment scheduling, patient reviews, and detailed doctor profiles, enhancing the user experience and ensuring transparency. 
