ancial firms. The company operates in the financial services market, focusing on credit risk data and analytics. By collecting and publishing these aggregated views, Credit Benchmark helps its clients monitor and manage credit risk within their portfolios, benchmark against industry standards, and gain insights into unrated entities. The business model revolves around providing subscription-based access to its data and analytics platform, generating revenue from financial institutions that rely on this information for risk management and investment decisions.\n\nKeywords: credit risk, financial institutions, consensus ratings, analytics, risk management, investment insights, portfolio monitoring, benchmark, unrated entities, subscription-based.","image":"storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/10/28/ca11461cfcdc845fc22ee905fb58e77d.png","dealroom_url":"https://app.dealroom.co/companies/credit_benchmark","links":{"website":"https://www.creditbenchmark.com/","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/credit-benchmark/","twitter":"https://twitter.com/creditbenchmark","instagram":null,"angellist":"https://angel.co/credit-benchmark-ltd","crunchbase":"http://www.crunchbase.com/organization/credit-benchmark"},"locations":[{"role":"hq","city":{"id":628061,"name":"London"},"state":{"id":130902,"name":"England"},"country":{"id":93,"name":"United Kingdom"},"continent":{"id":34,"name":"Europe"},"lat":51.520123,"lon":-0.0875417},{"role":"founding","city":{"id":628061,"name":"London"},"state":{"id":130902,"name":"England"},"country":{"id":93,"name":"United Kingdom"},"continent":{"id":34,"name":"Europe"},"lat":51.520123,"lon":-0.0875417}],"roles":[],"taxonomy":[{"id":10006,"name":"data management","type":"techstack_category"},{"id":12006,"name":"database","type":"techstack_category"},{"id":2295201,"name":"uk is8 financial services","type":"sector"},{"id":11606,"name":"data security","type":"techstack_category"},{"id":39406,"name":"sales","type":"techstack_category