null,"traffic":{"monthly_visits":450000,"growth_3m":-25},"available":["founders","traffic"]}', '2026-11-05T15:41:34.047Z', 'Peanut App Ltd. operates an online social network exclusively for women, focusing on life stages such as fertility, pregnancy, motherhood, and menopause. The company was co-founded in London, UK, in 2017 by Michelle Kennedy, who serves as CEO, and Greg Orlowski. Kennedy, formerly the deputy CEO of the dating app Badoo and an inaugural board member of Bumble, drew from her professional background and personal experience of feeling isolated as a new mother to create the platform. 
INSERT INTO companies (uuid, name, domain, website, linkedin, dealroom_url, tagline, hq_city, hq_country, launch_year, employees, employee_growth_1y, funding_total, funding_rounds, revenue, revenue_year, status, founders_json, raw_json, fetched_at, about, industries_json, classifications_json, signal_rating, monthly_visits, is_hiring, open_jobs, valuation, ebitda, ebitda_year, profit, profit_year, financials_json, financials_fetched_at, currency, last_round_date, last_round_label, last_round_amount) VALUES ('d5b3bb92-8c09-4e7b-a9cf-1ad0e150b965', 'Smol products', 'smolproducts.com', 'https://smolproducts.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/smolproducts/', 'https://app.dealroom.co/companies/smolproducts', 'Producing high performance, eco-friendly laundry capsules and dishwash tablets', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 2018, 141, 12.8, 32000000, 2, 44700000, 2025, 'operational', '[{"uuid":"c76fb96f-4dfc-4a64-8bd9-616395752899","name":"Paula Quazi"},{"uuid":"f89d50f8-26ae-4183-96ea-0e4010a5a5c0","name":"Nick Green"}]', '{"uuid":"d5b3bb92-8c09-4e7b-a9cf-1ad0e150b965","type":"organization","domain":"smolproducts.com","name":"Smol products","tagline":"Producing high performance, eco-friendly laundry capsules and dishwash tablets","about":"Smol products, established in 2018 by co-founders Paula Quazi and Nick Green, operates as a direct-to-consumer challenger in the home care market. The company''s inception was driven by the founders'' shared experience within the consumer goods industry, notably at Unilever, where they identified a gap for affordably priced, eco-conscious cleaning solutions. Quazi''s background in life sciences and extensive experience in product development, combined with Green''s commercial expertise, provided the foundation for a business model that bypasses traditional retail channels. \n \n The core of Smol''s business is a subscription-based service delivering concentrated, vegan, and cruelty-free laundry detergent capsules, dishwasher tablets, and other home cleaning products directly to consumers'' doors. This model allows the company to offer its products at a price point up to 50% lower than established brands. A key differentiator is the company''s commitment to reducing plastic waste; its primary packaging is plastic-free and recyclable, a significant departure from the bulky plastic containers common in the sector. The product formulations are another critical aspect, with a focus on high performance using fewer chemicals, demonstrated by their laundry capsules which are designed to be effective in both hot and cold washes. \n \n Since its launch, Smol has expanded its product line to include fabric conditioner, multi-purpose surface sprays, and personal care items like shampoo and body bars, all adhering to the same principles of sustainability and convenience. The company has demonstrated significant market traction, having served over half a million customers and sold more than 100 million laundry capsules by late 2020. This growth trajectory was further validated when the company achieved B Corp certification in July 2022, legally committing it to high standards of social and environmental performance, transparency, and accountability. Keywords: direct-to-consumer, subscription service, eco-friendly cleaning, home care, plastic-free packaging, sustainable products, B Corp, vegan cleaning, concentrated formulas, cruelty-free","image":"storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/10/10/a07900956f37bdd8ed1c90892827dcc4.png","dealroom_url":"https://app.dealroom.co/companies/smolproducts","links":{"website":"https://smolproducts.com","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/smolproducts/","twitter":"https://twitter.com/smolrevolution","instagram":null,"angellist":null,"crunchbase":null},"locations":[{"role":"hq","city":{"id":628061,"name":"London"},"state":{"id":130902,"name":"England"},"country":{"id":93,"name":"United Kingdom"},"continent":{"id":34,"name":"Europe"},"lat":51.514397,"lon":-