raditional approach to live music, organizing secret concerts in unconventional venues such as living rooms, galleries, breweries, and rooftops. These unique settings provide a platform for artist discovery and foster a sense of community and connection among attendees. The company also offers artist services aimed at helping performers manage their fan relationships and build sustainable careers. Sofar Sounds generates revenue through ticket sales for its live events and by providing various services to artists. The company serves a diverse clientele, including music enthusiasts seeking unique concert experiences and artists looking to grow their fan base and sustain their creative endeavors.
INSERT INTO companies (uuid, name, domain, website, linkedin, dealroom_url, tagline, hq_city, hq_country, launch_year, employees, employee_growth_1y, funding_total, funding_rounds, revenue, revenue_year, status, founders_json, raw_json, fetched_at, about, industries_json, classifications_json, signal_rating, monthly_visits, is_hiring, open_jobs, valuation, ebitda, ebitda_year, profit, profit_year, financials_json, financials_fetched_at, currency, last_round_date, last_round_label, last_round_amount) VALUES ('854b7994-cd71-4a5f-ae80-33f22b41bc00', 'Swoon', 'swooneditions.com', 'http://www.swooneditions.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/swoon-editions/', 'https://app.dealroom.co/companies/swoon_editions', 'Direct-to-consumer, data-driven, handcrafted designer furniture', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 2012, 64, 14.285714, 21515149, 4, 10585017, 2025, 'operational', '[{"uuid":"afa763e0-0642-4b5d-9d18-e533b67ae0a5","name":"Brian H"},{"uuid":"eebaee82-6b8f-4f10-9dfb-b74559346e3c","name":"Debbie Williamson"},{"uuid":"eda382ef-ada3-4e4b-8638-a7d643f3a8c1","name":"Brian Harrison"}]', '{"uuid":"854b7994-cd71-4a5f-ae80-33f22b41bc00","type":"organization","domain":"swooneditions.com","name":"Swoon","tagline":"Direct-to-consumer, data-driven, handcrafted designer furniture","about":"Swoon is a London-based, direct-to-consumer furniture brand founded in 2012 by Debbie Williamson and Brian Harrison. Williamson, with a background in digital product development and advertising, and Harrison, a former CEO of kgb deals, identified a gap in the market for beautifully designed, affordable furniture. The idea originated from Williamson''s personal experience of finding high-quality furniture to be prohibitively expensive. \n\nThe company operates on a disruptive business model that eliminates traditional retail overheads like showrooms and warehouses, connecting consumers directly with manufacturers and artisans worldwide. This vertically integrated approach significantly shortens the supply chain, allowing Swoon to offer handcrafted, designer pieces at fair prices. A core feature of its strategy is a data-centric, ''test and scale'' approach to design and production. The in-house design team, The Swoon Studio, leverages data analytics and social trends to create new designs monthly—a much faster cycle than the industry standard. These designs are initially released in small batches to a community of ''Insiders'' to gauge demand in real-time. Only the most popular items are scaled up for full production, minimizing waste and ensuring product-market fit. This agile process allows the company to launch multiple new designs daily. \n\nSwoon targets style-conscious, savvy professionals who are passionate about their home environments. The product catalog is extensive, including sofas, tables, chairs, beds, and lighting. The company has also expanded its reach through strategic collaborations with major retailers like John Lewis & Partners and M&S, as well as kitchen manufacturer Harvey Jones. Since its inception, Swoon has secured significant venture capital funding from investors including Octopus Ventures and Index Ventures, raising a total of $44.2M over four rounds. \n\nKeywords: direct-to-consumer furniture, online furniture retailer, handcrafted furniture, designer furniture, data-driven retail, small-batch production, home decor, interior design, furniture e-commerce, test and scale model, affordable luxury, furniture design, home furnishings, D2C brand, London startup, living room furniture, bedroom furniture, dining room furniture, accent chairs, lighting design","image":"storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/10/01/aa2aa6dc400c9a61b54423de2f920e49.png","dealroom_url":"https://app.dealroom.co/companies/swoon_editions","links":{"website":"http://www.swooneditions.com","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/swoon-editions/","twitter":"https://twitter.com/swooneditions","instagram":null,"angellist":"https://angel.co/swoo