r peers with diverse voice effects and sound clips. By integrating with various gaming and communication applications, Voicemod enhances user engagement and interaction, making it a popular choice among gaming enthusiasts. The company generates revenue through premium subscriptions, in-app purchases, and partnerships with gaming platforms. Voicemod''s offerings cater to a growing demand for personalized and immersive digital experiences, positioning it as a key player in the voice modulation segment.\nKeywords: voice changer, soundboard, gaming, freemium, PC users, content creators, Apex Legends, Call of Duty, digital entertainment, voice effects.","image":"storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/10/07/729795b7ea9df67cf351609e3060e321.png","dealroom_url":"https://app.dealroom.co/companies/voicemod","links":{"website":"http://www.voicemod.net","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/voicemod/","twitter":"https://twitter.com/voicemod","instagram":null,"angellist":"https://angel.co/company/voicemod","crunchbase":"https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/voicemod-s-l"},"locations":[{"role":"hq","city":{"id":6651,"name":"Valencia"},"state":{"id":444572,"name":"Valencian Community"},"country":{"id":283,"name":"Spain"},"continent":{"id":34,"name":"Europe"},"lat":39.477047,"lon":-0.3772347},{"role":"founding","city":{"id":6651,"name":"Valencia"},"state":{"id":444572,"name":"Valencian Community"},"country":{"id":283,"name":"Spain"},"continent":{"id":34,"name":"Europe"},"lat":39.477047,"lon":-0.3772347}],"roles":["investor"],"taxonomy":[{"id":1313,"name":"corporate","type":"investor_type"},{"id":10006,"name":"data management","type":"techstack_category"},{"id":12006,"name":"database","type":"techstack_category"},{"id":51406,"name":"software as a service","type":"techstack_category"},{"id":10001203,"name":"Media","type":"industry"},{"id":22906,"name":"human resource management system","type":"techstack_category"},{"id":114007,"name":"Venture Capital","type":