ny targets gamers, content creators, and online communities, offering tools to modify and enhance voice interactions during gameplay and streaming. Voicemod''s business model revolves around a freemium approach, where users can access basic features for free while premium features are available through subscription or one-time purchases. The platform supports popular games like Apex Legends and Call of Duty Warzone, allowing users to surprise and entertain their peers with diverse voice effects and sound clips. By integrating with various gaming and communication applications, Voicemod enhances user engagement and interaction, making it a popular choice among gaming enthusiasts. The company generates revenue through premium subscriptions, in-app purchases, and partnerships with gaming platforms. Voicemod''s offerings cater to a growing demand for personalized and immersive digital experiences, positioning it as a key player in the voice modulation segment.
INSERT INTO companies (uuid, name, domain, website, linkedin, dealroom_url, tagline, hq_city, hq_country, launch_year, employees, employee_growth_1y, funding_total, funding_rounds, revenue, revenue_year, status, founders_json, raw_json, fetched_at, about, industries_json, classifications_json, signal_rating, monthly_visits, is_hiring, open_jobs, valuation, ebitda, ebitda_year, profit, profit_year, financials_json, financials_fetched_at, currency, last_round_date, last_round_label, last_round_amount) VALUES ('5bc8ef38-505e-4ae1-a9c8-50e7dfc2e120', 'Worldsensing', 'worldsensing.com', 'http://worldsensing.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/worldsensing', 'https://app.dealroom.co/companies/worldsensing', 'Sensing solutions for smart cities and industries with critical assets in remote locations', 'Barcelona', 'Spain', 2008, 127, 0.7936508, 21877596, 14, 12651510, 2023, 'operational', '[{"uuid":"2839c6f8-c8ef-4c9e-8566-63ae08382bdb","name":"Xavier Vilajosana"},{"uuid":"ec4a0997-f8bf-49b3-b0ea-6c7df26c6228","name":"Ignasi Vilajosana"}]', '{"uuid":"5bc8ef38-505e-4ae1-a9c8-50e7dfc2e120","type":"organization","domain":"worldsensing.com","name":"Worldsensing","tagline":"Sensing solutions for smart cities and industries with critical assets in remote locations","about":"Worldsensing is a technology company specializing in IoT (Internet of Things) wireless monitoring solutions for critical infrastructures. The company focuses on enhancing safety and efficiency in industries such as construction, mining, rail, and civil infrastructure. By providing data loggers and sensors, Worldsensing enables continuous monitoring of structural integrity for large-scale projects like bridges, tunnels, and tailings dams. This helps prevent incidents and ensures safer operations.\n\nThe company primarily serves clients in the construction, mining, and rail industries, as well as those involved in managing civil infrastructure. These clients benefit from real-time data that helps them make informed decisions about the maintenance and safety of their assets.\n\nWorldsensing operates in the global market, with a presence in 70 countries. Its business model revolves around selling its IoT devices and offering related software services. The company generates revenue through the sale of its hardware products (sensors and data loggers) and through subscription-based software services that provide data analytics and monitoring capabilities.\n\nThe company has been recognized for its commitment to sustainability, being listed among 100 companies embracing circular economy practices. This means they focus on reducing waste and making the most of resources, which is increasingly important in today''s business environment.\n\nIn summary, Worldsensing leverages IoT technology to provide critical monitoring solutions that enhance safety and efficiency in various industries. By offering both hardware and software solutions, the company ensures continuous monitoring and data-driven decision-making for its clients.\n\nKeywords: IoT, wireless monitoring, critical infrastructure, construction, mining, rail, civil infrastructure, safety, data loggers, sensors.","image":"storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/10/08/2691d807023524d514750a273a0ac9a7.png","dealroom_url":"https://app.dealroom.co/companies/worldsensing","links":{"website":"http://worldsensing.com","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/worldsensing","twitter":"https://twitter.com/worldsensing","instagram":null,"angellist":"https://angel.co/company/worldsensing/funding","crunchbase":"https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/worldsensing"},"locations":[{"role":"hq","city":{"id":291,"name":"Barcelona"},"state":{"id":433072,"name":"Catalonia"},"country":{"id":283,"name":"Spain"},"continent":{"id":34,"name":"Europe"},"lat":41.38088,"lon":2.1412666},{"role":"founding","city":{"id":291,"name":"Barcelona"},"state":{"id":433072,"name":"Catalonia"},"country":{"id":283,"name":"Spain"},"continent":{"i